kur"},"title":["Āmāra jīvana"],"author":["by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["āmāra jīvana    sadā pāpe rata","    nāhika puṇyera leśa","parere udvega    diyāchhi ye kata","    diyāchhi jīvere kleśa"],"translation":["My life is always engrossed in sin. There is not a trace of piety within it. I have caused others so much anxiety and trouble."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["nija sukha lāgi’    pāpe nāhi ḍari","    dayā-hīna svārtha-para","para-sukhe duḥkhī    sadā mithya-bhāṣī","    para-duḥkha sukha-kara"],"translation":["I am never afraid to engage in sinful activities for the sake of my own happiness. I am merciless and selfish. I am a perpetual liar. I am saddened by the happiness of others and pleased by the sadness of others."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["aśeṣa kāmanā    hṛdi mājhe mora","    krodhī, dambha-parāyaṇa","mada-matta sadā    viṣaye mohita","    hiṁsā-garva vibhūṣana"],"translation":["There are unlimited sinful desires within the core of my heart. I am angry and arrogant, always maddened with vanity, infatuated with mundanity, and ornamented with malice and pride."],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["nidrālasya hata    sukārye virata","    akārye udyogī āmi","pratiṣṭhā lāgiyā    śāṭhya-ācharaṇa","    lobha-hata sadā kāmī"],"translation":["I am subdued by laziness and sleep, averse to performing good deeds, and eager to perform sinful deeds. I engage in deceitful behaviour in pursuit of prestige. I am ruined by greed and constantly covetous."],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["e hena durjana    sajjana-varjita","    aparādhi nirantara","śubha-kārya-śūnya    sadānartha-manāḥ","    nānā duḥkhe jara jara"],"translation":["Such a sinner as I is shunned by devotees, and is a constant offender. I am devoid of virtuous motives, always intent upon evil, and racked by various miseries."],"isLong":false},{"number":"6","text":["vārdhakye ekhana    upāya-vihīna","    tā’te dīna akiñchana","bhakati-vinoda    prabhura charaṇe","    kare duḥkha nivedana"],"translation":["Now aged, I am devoid of any means of deliverance and thus destitute and distressed. Bhakti Vinod submits this remorseful confession at the Lord’s feet."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.N. Acharya Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/kostya-netrebenko/017-amarajivana-1","personSlug":"srila-b-n-acharya-maharaj"},{"title":"Kamal Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/jayasri-sound/05-amara-jivana","personSlug":"kamal-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/amara-jivana","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Āmāra-jīvana-02-22"},"head":{"canonical":"/en-pe/amara-jivana-sada-pape-rata/","description":"Āmāra jīvana — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Pocket Kirtan Guide.","title":"Āmāra jīvana. by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en-pe","slug":"amara-jivana-sada-pape-rata"}}